.TH AVR\-SETTINGS\-RESET 1 "" "avr 0.1.5" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-settings-reset \- Remove a setting override, reverting to the inherited or default value.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr settings reset
[OPTIONS] KEY
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove a setting override, reverting to the inherited or default value.
.PP
Clears the repository override when run inside a connected checkout (the repo is auto-detected), when --repo is given, or when AVR_REPO is set. Pass --org to clear the organization-scoped value (this suppresses auto-detection).
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr settings reset cache.gha.enabled --repo rep-xyz789
    avr settings reset cache.packages.enabled --org org-abc123
.fi
.RE
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fIKEY\fR
\&
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Uses default org if not specified.
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fITEXT\fR
Repository (org/repo or rep-xxx). Auto-detected from git unless --org given.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-settings (1),
.BR avr-settings-list (1),
.BR avr-settings-schema (1),
.BR avr-settings-set (1)
